{"unit_id":"ph1996-cn__dsh-BMAD-Method#card-zh","repo":"ph1996-cn/dsh-BMAD-Method","commit":"adc36d53db64261b17d80865926c622cc90dad3e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-BMAD-Method 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 BMAD-Method 桥接插件：通过技能提供者把开发流程与角色 skills 提供给 DSH，并注册模块列表、开关和更新工具。用户可查看已安装与可用模块、启停模块、更新 BMAD，还能在插件设置卡片编辑用户名、语言和输出目录。适合希望在 DSH 中按流程完成产品规划、架构、开发和测试工作的用户。使用时不需 API key；外部模块安装可能需要访问 GitHub。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:248-285","index.js:287-408","client.js:76-90"]}
{"unit_id":"ph1996-cn__dsh-BMAD-Method#card-en","repo":"ph1996-cn/dsh-BMAD-Method","commit":"adc36d53db64261b17d80865926c622cc90dad3e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"BMAD workflows for DSH Web: native role skills and tools to list, toggle, and update modules. Settings cover user name, language, and output folder. Use it for guided product planning, architecture, development, and testing. No API key is needed; external module installation may require GitHub.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:248-285","index.js:287-408","client.js:76-90"]}
